          {
            "title": "Example 5",
            "id": 121355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Modifikasi kode sedemikian rupa sehingga mengimpor <code>bill</code> dan <code>total</code>. Selain itu, panggil fungsi dengan <code>bill</code> sebagai nilai dalam pernyataan <code>console.log</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"bill\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {bill, total};\" /></content></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {bill, total} \" /><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;./mod.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total(bill));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bill\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"45\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, lalu <code>total</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>total</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impor kedua named export, lalu panggil <code>total</code> dengan <code>bill</code> agar console mencetak jumlah setelah pajak.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"bill\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {bill, total};\" /></content></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {bill, total} \" /><text value=\"from\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;./mod.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total(bill));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bill\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"default\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"export\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"45\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, <code>total</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>total</code>, <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
